{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","hash":"d1482b18c82680cd41ee430609871d8a3b4401dedf453b864906aee8bcb5e7c3","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"First, a memory warning from your startup context. claude-mem's memory observer is down: \"Claude rejected the request because its five-hour usage allowance is exhausted.\" It won't record anything from this session until the allowance resets or you switch it to another provider in `~/.claude-mem/settings.json`.\n\nNow the three /usage fixes. I'll look first and propose each change before applying it."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FEkNPF4Hs1puRRzUBQTa4g","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/.claude; ls agents/; echo ---; for f in agents/*.md; do echo \"== $f\"; sed -n '1,12p' \"$f\" | grep -E '^(name|description|model|tools):' ; done; echo ---; ls skills/ | head -100; echo; ls skills | wc -l; echo ---; ls -d skills/loop* 2>/dev/null; find ~/.claude -path '*/loop/SKILL.md' 2>/dev/null | head","description":"List agent definitions and installed skills"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
