{"parentUuid":"68e2914c-f9c1-4ec7-90aa-0c13a03c2d8a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZa1QApvV1W2azBewDaR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the release state and found nothing I can act on yet. I'll check again in about 20 minutes. I didn't arm a Monitor.\n\n- **Evidence PRs (#352, #353, #354):** all three already have an independent ACCEPT on their current head, and all are mergeable. Their test checks are still running. They belong to other agents, so I'm not merging them.\n- **Provider evidence:** #352 replaces the old #346, which was blocked on missing receipts and logs. The provider packet is now independently accepted, so that gate looks nearly closed once #352 is green and merged.\n- **Overlap to watch:** #353 and #354 both restore the same 43 RC14 evidence logs, so only one should land.\n- **Held-out evaluation:** still blocked. The last recorded T2 re-check batch exited 1, and no handoff has been posted on issue #1."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_read_input_tokens":104092,"output_tokens":284,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":284,"cache_read_input_tokens":104092,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgZa1Pkn4Km88e6JRVhXG","requestRef":"0fd9fdee-5618-4414-9707-9a161fb17a42","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant"