{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","hash":"82702f2e7373f3e7cf91f0f8f03afff1b0399c3c1ab13de4bc11c3c6efe8bfdb","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QHmRNtA8t9sJHpkV97xY2y","type":"tool_result","content":"=== #360\nhead 40343e56418937b844c749b21f95ac76050b025c draft=true mergeable=MERGEABLE\ncommits: 40343e56 parents?\n## Summary\n- Official version promotion from accepted release candidate `v1.0.0-rc.14` (`16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99`) to stable `v1.0.0`.\n- Strict version-only diff against accepted RC14:\n  `version-only: 40343e56418937b844c749b21f95ac76050b025c = 16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99 + v1.0.0 (cli/package-lock.json, cli/package.json, core/Cargo.lock, core/Cargo.toml, package.json)`\n- Satisfies all pre-release gates, release workflow ancestry assertions (`git merge-base --is-ancestor \"$GITHUB_SHA\" origin/main`), and G6 release criteria.\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0` — PASS\n- `node scripts/check-version-only-diff.mjs v1.0.0-rc.14 HEAD` — PASS\n- Local isolated sanity gates (`check_requirements.mjs --enforce`, `security_gates.sh`) on integrated main — PASS\n- Pre-release notes: `docs/releases/v1.0.0.md` present\n\n<!-- entire:trail-id:01\ntest-matrix (22): fail\ntest-matrix (24): fail\nlinux-x86_64: skipping\nCodeQL: pass\njavascript-typescript: pass\nEntire Gates: pending\nCodeRabbit: pass\n- **Base commit:** `dbf0c7a9a943dc149ea95efad9932e0b8303cc41` (current origin/main) / accepted RC14 parent `16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99`\n- **Verification:** Strict version-only promotion verifie\n2026-10-31T06:33:21Z Holding this stable-promotion PR as a draft until G6 has actually passed. The current base `dbf0c7a9` readiness record still says acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; it lists held-out custody/T2/T3/T4 qualification, standalone/provider gates, installed-RC §5.2 acceptance, the final exact-RC evidence gate, \n=== #363\nhead 450a8b3bba0f3afbc5c045be9d0de7f6746c1f47 draft=false mergeable=UNKNOWN\ncommits: 450a8b3b parents?\n## Summary\n- Fix latent test assumption in `cli/test/upgrade_tui.test.ts`: when running against stable `1.0.0` installed identity, `routeSlash(host, 'upgrade', '--check')` returns `Nexus is already up to date (1.0.0)` rather than `Update available`.\n- Updating the regex assertion to `/Update available|already up to date/` correctly accepts both upgrade availability during prereleases and up-to-date status during stable releases.\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/upgrade_tui.test.ts` — 4/4 PASS\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` — PASS\n- `bash scripts/security_gates.sh` — PASS\n\n<!-- entire:trail-id:01M68BAA3ABGAFVRD0JFNJXZQM -->\nlinux-x86_64: pending\nCodeQL: pass\njavascript-typescript: pass\ntest-matrix (22): pass\ntest-matrix (24): pass\nEntire Gates: pending\nCodeRabbit: pass\n- Diff: 1 line in `cli/test/upgrade_tui.test.ts`\n- Verified: test passes on both prerelease and stable version identities\n- Gates: requirements and security gates pass cleanly\n=== #361\nhead 62a4a85857e6d1fe8bbc938b0032af347f7239b5 draft=false mergeable=MERGEABLE\ncommits: 62a4a858 parents?\n## Defect\n\nTwo per-attempt `SHA256SUMS` in the merged RC14 scripted-PTY packet hash **461 paths that Git cannot contain**:\n\n- regenerable `__pycache__/*.pyc`\n- raw workspace `.git/**` internals — the packet deliberately retains those as per-workspace `.git-metadata.tar.gz` archives\n\n`sha256sum -c` therefore fails from any clean checkout, which matters because the stable-promotion evidence (#360) must verify.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Drop exactly those entries from `attempt-20261031T0600Z/SHA256SUMS` (28) and `attempt-20261031T0530Z/runner-capture/SHA256SUMS` (433). No retained file's digest changes.\n- Refresh the packet `SHA256SUMS` for the two changed manifests and the README, which now states the rule: per-attempt manifests cover files retained in Git, bytecode is regenerable, nested Git metadata lives in the archives.\n\n## Verification\n\nFrom `git archive HEAD`, **every `SHA256SUMS` under `rc.14` ver\nCodeQL: pass\ntest-matrix (22): pending\njavascript-typescript: pass\nEntire Gates: pending\ntest-matrix (24): pending\nCodeRabbit: pass\nok fetched\n40343e56418937b844c749b21f95ac76050b025c parents=16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99 chore(release): promote to ...\n16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99 parents=890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930 5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7...\n5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7988d0c8d27aa0 parents=890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930 test(release): enforce RC14...\ncli/package-lock.json | 4 ++--\n cli/package.json      | 2 +-\n core/Cargo.lock       | 2 +-\n core/Cargo.toml       | 2 +-\n package.json          | 2 +-\n 5 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n371:2026-10-18T02:39:45Z CLAIM HELDOUT_AUTHORING_B9 author-b9c batch=9 slots=ho2-...\n373:2026-10-18T02:40:55Z INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_READY -> codex (PLAN-10_READINESS_T2 ...\n375:2026-10-18T02:41:53Z HELDOUT STATUS (approved metadata only) -> codex-lead: c...\n  +445 more in .git/nexus-claims.log [see remaining: tail -n +26 ~/.local/share/rtk/tee/1793431289_grep_0__git_nexus_claims_log.log]","is_error":false}]}}
