{"parentUuid":"42afced7-0eeb-46b0-b727-1d7caf6bb00a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"84e33525-af92-4a0b-b86e-f1359bfa27fb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<command-message>loop</command-message>\n<command-name>/loop</command-name>\n<command-args>drive work actively to v1.0.0 release.</command-args>"},"uuid":"e48e47ef-89a4-405c-80b7-c3dc6fae80fa","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:48:02.758Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","scheduledTaskId":"290ba56b","scheduledFireId":"42afced7-0eeb-46b0-b727-1d7caf6bb00a","turnOrigin":"scheduled","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":53,"turnIndex":363},"queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-sleeping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"e48e47ef-89a4-405c-80b7-c3dc6fae80fa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"84e33525-af92-4a0b-b86e-f1359bfa27fb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /home/mike/.claude/skills/loop\n\n# /loop\nParse input as `[interval] <prompt>`: a first token matching ^\\d+[smhd]$ is the interval; else a trailing `every <N> <unit>` (only when a time follows \"every\"); else no interval (dynamic). Empty prompt → print `/loop [interval] <prompt>` and stop.\n\n## Fixed interval\nCron: Nm≤59 → `*/N * * * *`; Nm≥60 or Nh → `0 */H * * *`; Nd → `0 0 */N * *`; Ns → round up to minutes. Round uneven intervals to the nearest clean one and say so. CronCreate (recurring: true), confirm cadence + job ID in one line (expires after 7 days; cancel with CronDelete), then run the prompt now.\n\n## Dynamic\n1. Run the prompt now (slash command → Skill tool).\n2. If the next run waits on an event, arm one Monitor (timeout_ms 1800000) unless TaskList shows one running.\n3. If work remains: ScheduleWakeup with prompt `/loop <original input>`, delaySeconds 1200–1800 unless something specific changes sooner, noop true when nothing changed. Re-arming is a choice, not a default.\n4. Confirm in one short visible line.\n5. To stop: ScheduleWakeup stop:true, TaskStop any Monitor, one-line PushNotification (skip if the user asked to stop), then write the outcome.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: drive work actively to v1.0.0 release."}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"42ccbd94-3b79-4dde-afb9-747a70cec8e0","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:48:02.758Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-sleeping-unicorn"}
