{"parentUuid":"80010f79-8654-44f5-82ce-79a49088de0b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"84e33525-af92-4a0b-b86e-f1359bfa27fb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UrRruhEzZoP9sXP3TPAien","type":"tool_result","content":"cli/package-lock.json         |  4 ++--\n cli/package.json              |  2 +-\n core/Cargo.lock               |  2 +-\n core/Cargo.toml               |  2 +-\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.15.md | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n package.json                  |  2 +-\n 6 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.15 release candidate\n\n**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\n\n**Status:** this candidate is the final release qualification candidate for stable v1.0.0 promotion.\n\nThis release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`.\n\n## Changes since RC14\n\n### Qualification evidence and release candidate alignment\n- Integrates all Gate 6 qualification evidence packets: scripted installed-RC PTY scenarios (ACCEPTANCE §5.2), complete provider receipts, synthetic-journal and checksum-tamper durability cells, cross-runner builds, and comprehensive Gate 10 disclosures.\n- Includes narrow composer hints in the live TUI layout (PR #359).\n- Resolves latent test suite assumption in `cli/test/upgrade_tui.test.ts` to accommodate both upgrade-available and up-to-date assertions across prerelease and stable lifecycle transitions (PR #363).\n\n## Runtime requirements\n\n- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\n- Node.js 22 or newer.\n- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\n\nThe archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\n\n## Candidate assets\n\nThe release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.15` produces the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance.\n~/nexus-code 31303130 [main]\n~/df/wt/t1 2860228c [dogfood/c1-t1]\n~/df/wt/t2 2860228c [dogfood/c1-t2]\n\nNode.js v24.11.1","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2162e55c-0b61-4804-8e6a-57bf52a4b6db","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:48:37.721Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"cli/package-lock.json         |  4 ++--\n cli/package.json              |  2 +-\n core/Cargo.lock               |  2 +-\n core/Cargo.toml               |  2 +-\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.15.md | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n package.json                  |  2 +-\n 6 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.15 release candidate\n\n**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\n\n**Status:** this candidate is the final release qualification candidate for stable v1.0.0 promotion.\n\nThis release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`.\n\n## Changes since RC14\n\n### Qualification evidence and release candidate alignment\n- Integrates all Gate 6 qualification evidence packets: scripted installed-RC PTY scenarios (ACCEPTANCE §5.2), complete provider receipts, synthetic-journal and checksum-tamper durability cells, cross-runner builds, and comprehensive Gate 10 disclosures.\n- Includes narrow composer hints in the live TUI layout (PR #359).\n- Resolves latent test suite assumption in `cli/test/upgrade_tui.test.ts` to accommodate both upgrade-available and up-to-date assertions across prerelease and stable lifecycle transitions (PR #363).\n\n## Runtime requirements\n\n- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\n- Node.js 22 or newer.\n- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\n\nThe archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\n\n## Candidate assets\n\nThe release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.15` produces the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance.\n~/nexus-code 31303130 [main]\n~/df/wt/t1 2860228c [dogfood/c1-t1]\n~/df/wt/t2 2860228c [dogfood/c1-t2]\n\nNode.js v24.11.1","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"80010f79-8654-44f5-82ce-79a49088de0b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-sleeping-unicorn"}
