{"parentUuid":"f8c280dc-c4e4-4457-b3f4-4fe11779ed26","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZzK1CWExZ3qRnTzeD35","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"rc.15 is tagged and its release build is running (run 41184096797). I haven't verified the artifact yet. I'll check at 08:46Z.\n\n- **Merged over my review:** #364 merged at 08:13Z with my changes-required review on its release notes unaddressed. The tag `v1.0.0-rc.15` then went on the merge commit `865e342d`. I didn't take over the notes fix because the tag landed before my planned 08:20Z check.\n- **What that means:** the rc.15 notes still overclaim qualification. Tagged notes can't be edited, so qualification status has to come from the gate evidence, not from the notes. I logged that.\n- **Next:** once the build publishes, I'll verify the rc.15 artifact independently, as I did for rc.14. The v1.0.0 stable commit then gets rebuilt on rc.15, which the earlier test failure made necessary.\n- **Still open:** held-out evaluation is blocked, and #361 and #362 are waiting on merge."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":954,"cache_read_input_tokens":136463,"output_tokens":330,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":954,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":136463,"cache_creation_input_tokens":954,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":954},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgZzJzve5g9Unjj37A1Jf","requestRef":"089805a5-d0b1-44d6-869c-db7a4369f3f5