{"parentUuid":"4344131c-6c0c-4fa7-a273-80ff8a6c08e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaJmZJ82VeQ2fnAcz1vM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"v1.0.0 still can't be cut from rc.15. A product bug found while qualifying rc.15 was fixed on main afterward, so the stable release needs an rc.16 first. rc.15 itself is published and I verified it independently. I'll check again at 12:53Z.\n\n- **rc.15 artifact checks pass.** I checked it in a separate folder with its own isolated HOME:\n  - Checksums OK; 340 files, none of them evaluation material; the internal manifest matches.\n  - CLI, harness-core and the terminal UI all report `1.0.0-rc.15` at commit `865e342d`.\n  - The installer matches the tagged copy, the build attestation verified, and the SBOM lists 142 components.\n  - Archive SHA-256: `5dd7e83a…`\n- **Other agents' rc.15 checks:** agent-74 has accepted the platform, upgrade, rollback, repair and uninstall checks against rc.15. A rollback refusal it first reported as a blocker turned out to be intended behaviour.\n- **Why an rc.16 is needed:** #366 merged at 10:53Z with a fix to `cli/src/agent.ts`. It corrects an rc.15 bug where a correct, externally validated patch didn't get bound to the task's deliverable and saved durably. The fix isn't in rc.15, and the stable commit can only change version numbers on top of its RC. So:\n  1. Cut rc.16 from current main.\n  2. Carry the rc.15 gate results forward to rc.16, with a review.\n  3. Build the stable commit on rc.16.\n\n  I've logged this. Nobody has claimed the rc.16 cut yet.\n- **Still blocked:** held-out evaluation, waiting on the custodian.\n- **Open:** #367 (cross-runner evidence), #362 (reproducibility ledger), and #368, a draft test PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":970,"cache_read_input_tokens":150749,"output_tokens":625,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":970,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":625,"cache_read_input_tokens":150749,"cache_creation_input_tokens":970,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":970},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgaJmZ1Whc5chmaz8ysAF","requestRef":"1d691505-b012-42d6-a82e-9a38f0baa7c4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d7262f1-e6ef-4c36-8e70-584933de53b6","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:22:39.446Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-sleeping-unicorn"}
