{"parentUuid":"9389b65a-15b7-4e77-9079-d55dccb3011c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06d5af52-4efa-464b-8673-7134e4d2d0cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TBCcsGHrLioabFdKTKmy2D","type":"tool_result","content":"41187337154 v1.0.0 completed success 2026-10-31T09:06:53Z\n41184096797 v1.0.0-rc.15 completed success 2026-10-31T08:19:01Z\n41035120551 v1.0.0-rc.14 completed success 2026-10-30T09:40:16Z\n41009328850 v1.0.0-rc.13 completed cancelled 2026-10-30T05:36:00Z\nv1.0.0\tLatest\tv1.0.0\t2026-10-31T11:22:22Z\nv1.0.0-rc.15\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.15\t2026-10-31T08:44:25Z\nv1.0.0-rc.14\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.14\t2026-10-30T10:01:32Z\nv1.0.0-rc.11\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.11\t2026-10-30T00:17:45Z\npre=false draft=false 2026-10-31T11:22:22Z\n# Nexus Code v1.0.0 Release Notes & Migration Guide\n\n**Maturity:** Release candidate documentation. Stable `v1.0.0` has not been published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\nThis release delivers the complete Nexus Code client architecture with comprehensive boundary hardening, process ownership, workspace trust enforcement, and egress protection.\n\n**Runtime requirement:** Node.js 22 or newer. Node.js 20 and older are unsupported.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Security & Untrusted Input Boundary Hardening (PLAN-03)\n\n### Workspace `.env` Isolation & Allowlist (REQ-SEC-110)\n- **Problem addressed (PRV-01):** Workspace `.env` files previously loaded with `override: true`, allowing untrusted repositories to manipulate `NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED`, proxy configurations, credential variables, timeouts, and fallback endpoints.\n- **New behavior:** Project `.env` files are parsed into an isolated `EffectiveConfig` layer and are **never** assigned to `process.env`.\n- **Allowed project keys:**\n  - `LOCAL_LLM_ENDPOINT`\n  - `LOCAL_LLM_MODEL`\n  - `LOCAL_LLM_TASK_CLASS`\n  - `NEXUS_CONTEXT_LIMIT`\n  - Any key starting with the documented prefix `NEXUS_PROJECT_*`\n- **Ignored project keys:** All other environment keys—including `NODE_*`, `*_PROXY`, `HOME`, `PATH`, `SSL_*`, provider credentials (`OPENAI_API_KEY`, etc.), `LOCAL_LLM_API_KEY`, `LOCAL_LLM_TIMEOUT_MS`, and `LOCAL_LLM_FALLBACK_ENDPOINTS`—are ignored with startup notices and flagged in `nexus doctor`.\n- **Escape hatch:** For transition during pre-1.0 \ntag\n501eab6885021b34fdea457cde96b7c6dccddad1\n3003:2026-10-23T08:09:22Z OWNER_DIRECTIVE (owner to claude-code, relayed verbatim)...\n3010:2026-10-23T08:48:30Z RC_TAG_PUSHED tag=v1.0.0-rc.3 tag_object=dd68c222c57d0be...\n3150:2026-10-23T16:23:28Z claude-code INDEPENDENT_REVIEW PR164 head=730b522ed39480...\n3166:2026-10-23T16:46:32Z claim FILE_docs_releases_v1.0.0-rc.4.md agent=/root bran...\n  +43 more in .git/nexus-claims.log [see remaining: tail -n +26 ~/.local/share/rtk/tee/1793451205_grep_0__git_nexus_claims_log.log]\n- **Head commit:** `501eab6885021b34fdea457cde96b7c6dccddad1`\n- **Base commit:** `865e342d481d427c8ea7ecb0088fc5fda7e89f6f` (`origin/main`, tag `v1.0.0-rc.15`)\n- **Version verification:** `node scripts/check-version-only-diff.mjs v1.0.0-rc.15 HEAD` passes cleanly: strict version-only diff on 5 manifests (`package.json`, `cli/package.json`, `cli/package-lock.json`, `\n2026-10-31T08:33:42Z Release-coordination correction (2026-10-31): this is an unmerged stable-version promotion proposal only. RC15 has not been accepted; exact-RC qualification remains in progress and held-out custody/T2/T3/T4 plus other mandatory gates are unresolved. Source CI on this promotion branch does not establish acceptance. The PR description statements “accepted candidate” and “fully qualified” are not cur","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ca9777eb-53e8-451d-a9b8-05706d01a7c5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:53:26.249Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"41187337154 v1.0.0 completed success 2026-10-31T09:06:53Z\n41184096797 v1.0.0-rc.15 completed success 2026-10-31T08:19:01Z\n41035120551 v1.0.0-rc.14 completed success 2026-10-30T09:40:16Z\n41009328850 v1.0.0-rc.13 completed cancelled