{"parentUuid":"0ab5bdf5-b7af-4bee-9c58-26e04a5b84bb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06d5af52-4efa-464b-8673-7134e4d2d0cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"<tool_use_error>InputValidationError: [\n  {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_value\",\n    \"values\": [\n      \"proactive\"\n    ],\n    \"path\": [\n      \"status\"\n    ],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid input: expected \\\"proactive\\\"\"\n  }\n]</tool_use_error>","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NY77SBwoL8pCUvphA4jCAo"}]},"uuid":"d125619b-cb19-407d-9af8-abd43d350fe2","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:53:52.539Z","toolUseResult":"InputValidationError: [\n  {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_value\",\n    \"values\": [\n      \"proactive\"\n    ],\n    \"path\": [\n      \"status\"\n    ],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid input: expected \\\"proactive\\\"\"\n  }\n]","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0ab5bdf5-b7af-4bee-9c58-26e04a5b84bb","session_id":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-sleeping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"d125619b-cb19-407d-9af8-abd43d350fe2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaMAMy8ECCKfd4NzLD8q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I stopped the loop. v1.0.0 stable is already published, and I need your decision on it. The push notification failed with a validation error, so this message is the only alert.\n\n**What happened**\n- **Merge and tag:** PR #365, a version-only change on top of rc.15, was merged at 09:06Z from your account. The `v1.0.0` tag points at it. The commit contains the five version files and nothing else.\n- **Release run:** the stable release workflow (run 41187337154) ran from 09:06Z. It was cancelled once, failed once on one CLI test, and was re-run until it succeeded. Its sixth attempt ran from your account (`mikeholownych`) and finished at 11:21Z.\n- **Published:** the GitHub release was published at 11:22Z. It is marked Latest and is not a pre-release. The workflow created it at 09:06Z, so it was probably a draft that was published at 11:22Z.\n\nI can't tell whether you or an agent sharing that account re-ran the workflow, since the account is shared. The shared log has no entry recording a decision to publish.\n\n**Why I think it's premature**\n- **Held-out evaluation:** custody, T2, T3 and T4 are still unresolved. The last update on issue #1 was at 00:12Z.\n- **Independent rejection:** agent-74 rejected stable readiness at 09:38Z because there was no rc.15 qualification record and no independent review of #365. I found nothing in the log reversing that.\n- **Missing fix:** rc.15 doesn't include the #366 fix, which merged at 10:53Z. That fix is for a durable-journal bug found during rc.15 qualification.\n- **Release notes:** the published v1.0.0 release body says \"Stable `v1.0.0` has not been published; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\"\n\n**What I did and didn't do**\n- I logged the observation in the shared log.\n- I did not delete or change the release or the tag. That is outward-facing and your call.\n- I verified the rc.15 build earlier, but I have not verified the v1.0.0 build.\n\n**Your options**\n1. **Keep it.** This is only right if you consider the held-out gate waived. I'd then check the v1.0.0 artifact and file the missing acceptance record.\n2. **Demote it.** Mark it as a pre-release and take the Latest label off. This is reversible, and I'd recommend it. Gate work then continues toward a corrected rc.16 and a clean stable cut.\n3. **Pull it.** Delete the release and the tag. This is the hardest to undo, because anyone who already installed it keeps it.\n\nI'll do whichever you choose. Restart `/loop` to continue."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":157361,"output_tokens":881,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":881,"cache_read_input_tokens":157361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgaMAMZoUxBZN1g33ZbDE","requestRef":"4713b465-0a77-4e72-bc81-b2f511e2296e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"4e9087b2-0159-44e6-a135-945d154d55ed","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:54:00.039Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403","